{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27623","headline":"送周尚书赴滑台 · 张祜","name":"送周尚书赴滑台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚谣襦袴整三年，喉舌新恩下九天。\n鼓角雄都分节钺，蛇龙旧国罢楼船。\n崑河已在兵钤内，堂柳空留鹤岭前。\n多病无由酬一顾，鄢陵千骑去翩翩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}